    thinking: "**Mapping Subjects to Types**\n\nI\'m currently working on `/src/components/StudyHub.tsx`, a key feature. I\'m focusing on the \"Asignatura \342\206\222 Tipo Pok\303\251mon\" mapping. I\'ve started the mapping process by associating subjects like Matem\303\241ticas to Ps\303\255quico and Lengua to Normal. I\'ve also linked Ingl\303\251s/Franc\303\251s to Volador and Biolog\303\255a to Planta. I\'ll continue filling out this mapping.\n\n\n**Expanding Subject Mapping**\n\nI\'ve expanded the subject-to-Pok\303\251mon type mapping. Chemistry and Physics are now Fire/Electric, Geography/History is Earth/Rock, Physical Education is Fighting, Technology/Digitalization is Steel, Music is Fairy, Plastic Education is Ice, and Ethics/Religion is Psychic/Fairy.\n\n\n\n"
