  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Audio for the App**\n\nI\'m currently focused on designing the audio aspects of the app. My main idea involves a procedural 8-bit/chiptune music and sound effects generator, built entirely within the Web Audio API. This will keep everything self-contained and eliminate any reliance on external resources. I\'m exploring how to generate sounds from Pokemon music.\n\n\n**Exploring Music & Context**\n\nI\'ve been mapping specific tracks to different app sections to create a cohesive audio experience. I\'m thinking of a \"Route 1\" theme for dashboards, while a \"Pokemon Center\" theme fits the party screen. The shop might get the \"Pok\303\251 Mart\" theme. I\'m also planning controls, like play/mute toggles, volume, and an animated equalizer bar, and the ability to switch tracks, seamlessly.\n\n\n"
