  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing The Interface**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the interface components, specifically `Header.tsx`. I need to ensure the daily streak, represented by `{trainer.dailyStreak} d`, is prominently displayed. I\'m also ensuring the desktop view includes the Pok\303\251dex logo, the trainer\'s name and level, and the lead Pok\303\251mon. Right now, it\'s about the visual hierarchy and clarity for the user.\n\n\n**Refining Mobile Header**\n\nI\'ve made progress on the mobile header. I\'ve focused on displaying the daily streak, steps, and coins clearly. I\'ve integrated the sound button and Google Fit sync icon as well. I\'m prioritizing a clean, uncluttered layout with precise spacing. I\'ve also removed the top bar and made some changes to the Navigation, including adding the `sexual_health` and `avatar_customizer` tabs.\n\n\n**Developing Trainer Features**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the core trainer features. The comprehensive profile management in `TrainerAuthModal.tsx` and `TrainerCustomizerModal.tsx` is coming together, including login, registration, and Google Auth with an account switcher. I\'m building out the avatar selector with the full gallery of Pok\303\251mon trainers, along with customizers for trainer class, motto, and favorite type.\nI\'m building a Google Fit sync modal, `GoogleFitModal.tsx`, as well. I\'ve almost finished the OAuth connection and steps sync from the Web API, including goal adjustment features. I\'ve began to develop the `SexualHealthTab.tsx`, a discreet sexual health module, including a tracker with mood and energy ratings.\n\n\n**Expanding Health Tracker**\n\nI\'ve added a body measurement tracker to the sexual health module, including length, girth, date and notes. There\'s now a private gallery with a 4-digit PIN, discreet camouflage mode and image upload features. I\'m focusing on local storage and tag management. Also, I\'m working on the `StudyHub`, with Trimestres display, direct grade editing, custom subject addition and exam photo uploads.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 11
      nanos: 359736281
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
