  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Expanding Audio Library**\n\nI\'ve been examining the audio engine in `src/utils/audio.ts` \342\200\223 it\'s well-structured. I\'m aiming to enrich it by incorporating iconic Pok\303\251mon tracks. Specifically, I plan to add \"Route 1 & Pallet Town\" for adventure, \"Pok\303\251mon Center & Healing,\" and \"Pok\303\251mon Mart & Bazaar\" for variety. I\'m excited by the possibilities this opens up.\n\n\n**Adding More Pok\303\251mon Music**\n\nI\'m now diving deeper into the Pok\303\251mon music additions. I\'ve curated tracks like \"Lo-Fi Chill Pok\303\251mon Beats,\" various battle themes, the victory fanfare, and iconic locations such as \"Pallet Town\" and \"Lavender Town.\" I\'m also adding \"Surf Theme\" and \"Camp Lofi.\" I\'m also adding a shuffle mode and exploring automatic transitions to lo-fi tracks for the Pomodoro timer. I\'ve started reviewing Pok\303\251mon needs and berry cultivation, beginning with the `PartyPokemon` struct.\n\n\n**Defining Pok\303\251mon States**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining Pok\303\251mon\'s internal states. I\'m introducing parameters like mood, hunger, happiness, cleanliness, and energy, each with numerical values. I\'ve also incorporated time-based properties for the last feeding, petting, and cleaning actions. This is all helping make the creatures more dynamic.\n\n\n\n**Implementing Berry Gardens**\n\nI\'m now outlining the `BerryPlot` structure, including `id`, `berryType`, `plantedAt`, and growth-related properties. I\'m focusing on making growth durations react to player actions, with times between 30 and 90 seconds for a rewarding feel. Watering will accelerate growth, and fertilization will be included. Harvest yields (2-5 berries) are also being considered. I\'m also planning the different stages: empty, planted, sprout, growing, and ready. I\'m excited to start implementing this, now!\n\n\n**Designing Pok\303\251mon Interactions**\n\nI\'m now detailing interactive actions with my Pok\303\251mon. I\'m focusing on displaying their needs (hunger, happiness, cleanliness, energy) and moods. I\'m implementing actions like feeding berries with eating animations and hearts, petting and playing with happy sounds and confetti, and bathing and brushing with bubbles to increase cleanliness. Siestas will restore energy with a \"Zzz\" animation.\n\n\n**Adding Academic Rewards**\n\nI\'m now implementing academic rewards, considering milestones based on grades in the \"Estudios\" section. I\'ve defined automatic rewards with chests for each grade level, including Pok\303\251balls, berries, and potions. There\'s an \"Reclamar Recompensa\" button. I\'m also now designing the structure to attach real photos of exams and notes to each test, with associated grades and subjects.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 515743311
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
