  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Pokemon Care**\n\nI\'m currently focused on implementing the new `PokemonCareTab.tsx` component. The core areas under consideration are the care system, specifically the Pokemon team selector, and the berry garden functionality. I\'m prioritizing the Pokemon team selector, aiming for an efficient way to choose one, or all, of the team\'s Pokemon. The berry garden will follow the selector.\n\n\n**Defining Pokemon Care Metrics**\n\nI\'ve been defining the care metrics: hunger, happiness, cleanliness, energy, affection (0-100), and mood. I\'m planning interactions to affect them, like feeding with berries from the inventory with retro sounds and animations. Bathing/grooming with bubbles increases cleanliness and happiness. Mini-games like ball-catching boost affection and happiness. Resting restores energy, and petting increases affection.\n\n\n"
